OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSome
OL,6,Fsunshine to end the day in the east,
OL,7,Fthough cloudier across Cornwall. Cloud
OL,8,Fis expected to generally feed across
OL,9,Fthe region from the northwest, with
OL,10,Fsome light rain or showers possible by
OL,11,Fmorning. Mild.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FThursday morning will be
OL,14,Fcloudy with the odd spot of rain.
OL,15,FSkies will brighten from the northwest
OL,16,Fin the afternoon leaving a mostly fine
OL,17,Fevening. Fresh in gentle northwesterly
OL,18,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
