OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FFriday
OL,6,Fand the weekend will hold onto a
OL,7,Ffresher feel. However, with high
OL,8,Fpressure building back across the
OL,9,Fregion it will be largely dry with
OL,10,Fsome warm sunshine at times.
